    "title": "CCCC Community Music Ensembles Looking for Members - NewsBreak",
    "text": "ncktoday.com\nwebsite\nConcordia\nCCCC Community Music Ensembles Looking for Members\n1 days ago\nCloud County Community College’s community music ensembles, under the direction of music instructor Chris Langsford, are accepting new members. The ensembles, Pep Band, Rolling Thunder Drumline, Community Concert Band, Cloud 9 Jazz Choir, Community Chorale and Cloud Kicks Jazz Band are all open to both Cloud students and members of the community, ages high school and older.",
